  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APMDD - Transparency and financial flows</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will strengthen the civil society movement to reduce IFFs and improve domestic resource mobilisation with a focus on increasing CSO influence over decision-makers to change policies to increase transparency of financial flows and support tax justice. APMDD will focus its work in Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
